<title>UK: INSIGHT - ALUMINIUM TO PAUSE, COPPER SETTLE BACK.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT - ALUMINIUM TO PAUSE, COPPER SETTLE BACK.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> 3 MONTH     CLOSE  * SUPPORT * RESIST * RSI14 * MA10 * MA30</p>
<p> COPPER     2326/29 *  2310   *  2340  *  50   * 2322 * 2328</p>
<p> ALUMINIUM  1755/58 *  1700   *  1775  *  77   * 1718 * 1636</p>
<p>---------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - Aug 8 ------------------</p>
<p>Aluminium prices are expected to opt for technical consolidation on Friday, having run up to $1,775 22-month highs on Thursday, leaving a downside gap to fill, analysts said.</p>
<p>Copper may settle back slightly, although the market seems established above $2,300/10, they added.</p>
